      <p class="text-sm text-[#475569] mb-6 max-w-lg mx-auto">Original research. Editorial placement. Visibility measurement across search and AI.</p>
      <PrimaryCTA href="/contact" label="Start a Campaign" />
    </div>

  </div>
</article>

